==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Flaaffy|39}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*'''Zap Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Emerald|Manectric|16}} from the {{TCG|EX Emerald}} expansion.
